  "_comment": [
    "FROZEN Tier 2 descriptor standardisation (A10), pinned by amendment A16 on 15-09-2026.",
    "These are the centres and scales the sealed Tier 2 secondary prediction 2 distances were",
    "measured under: 3.2115 (L. fuscus), 2.4447 (C. lupus), 1.8777 (M. angustirostris).",
    "",
    "Why this file exists. results/regime_descriptor_standardisation.json is rewritten by",
    "regime_profile.py --decide-threshold over whatever rows are in results/regime_profiles.csv",
    "at that moment. Profiling the A9 QC rebuild (21 species, cleaned) moved it once; profiling",
    "the 11 Tier 3 bird candidates (32 species) moved it again. Neither run touched the six role",
    "species' raw descriptors, which A2 protects, but both moved the centre and scale, and the",
    "distances move with them. The script's own drift guard could not see this because it",
    "compared the standardisation file against the profile table, and the same branch rewrites",
    "both, so the two always agreed. Nothing reported was wrong when reported; it simply stopped",
    "being reproducible.",
    "",
    "Provenance: computed by descriptor_standardisation() over the 21 species in",
    "results/regime_profiles_pre_qc.csv, which is the profile table as it stood at the Tier 2",
    "freeze. results/regime_descriptor_standardisation.json continues to exist and continues to",
    "move; it is a screening artefact for Tier 3/4 candidate comparison and no sealed script",
    "reads it. Do not regenerate this file."
  ],
